ego’s","client_asin":"B0DG217MG1","client_asin_title":"Keego Motorized Skylight Cellular Shades (Blackout)","competitors":[{"advantage_over_rival":"You hold a higher rating (4.4 vs. 4.2) and a motorized, skylight-specific use case that improves relevance and willingness to pay among skylight shoppers; their generic cellular shade cannot match that fit.","asin":"ABCDEFGHI1","monthly_revenue":"81,544","rival_title":"Blackout Cellular Shades Cordless Blinds Window Shades for ","strength_of_rival":"2,526 reviews, Amazon’s Choice, and FBA/Prime combine social proof + convenience; at $90.39, they undercut your price and win broader “any-window” demand—driving outsized volume."},{"advantage_over_rival":"You can present a direct value edge (~$9 lower price) while keeping a 4.4 rating and skylight specificity; pairing this with clearer specs narrows their messaging advantage.","asin":"ABCDEFGHI2","monthly_revenue":"44,362","rival_title":"Motorized Blinds with Remote, 100% Blackout Smart Blinds ","strength_of_rival":"Polished listing and clear smart-home messaging plus Prime fulfillment lift conversion at a higher $109 price; persuasive bullets reduce friction and reinforce quality."},{"advantage_over_rival":"Your pricing is ~21% lower ($99.99 vs. ~$126.96) with comparable review level (95 vs. 96), enabling a stronger value story once benefits and installation details are surfaced.","asin":"ABCDEFGHI3","monthly_revenue":"10,850","rival_title":"Zshine Motorized Cellular Shades Cordless Honeycomb Blinds","strength_of_rival":"Broader variant set and spec-rich bullets make selection easy and reduce returns; at ~$126.96, they still convert due to clarity and perceived quality."}],"first_name":"Barry","has_rivals":true,"key_finding":"badge- & Prime-driven substitution risk","market_analysis_summary":["Despite your 4.4 rating on 95 reviews and $5,874.75/month, you currently rank 8th of 11 by revenue. Your $99.99 price and motorized, skylight-specific positioning create relevance tha